*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : PEN0040
*> PURPOSE : PENALTY ASSESSMENT RULES
*> AUTHOR  : R.T.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-03-12 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-11-08 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 198
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB PENNIGHT STEP030
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PEN0040.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    COPY PEN0040C.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    *> LATE PAYMENT PENALTY
    05 LATE-CHARGE        PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM 2000-LATE-PENALTY
    DISPLAY "LATE-CHARGE=" LATE-CHARGE
    STOP RUN.
2000-LATE-PENALTY.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        *> EARLY LATE PAYMENT FEE
        WHEN DAYS-LATE >= 1 AND DAYS-LATE <= 10
            MOVE 25 TO LATE-CHARGE
        *> LATE PAYMENT FEE
        WHEN DAYS-LATE >= 11 AND DAYS-LATE <= 45
            MOVE 50 TO LATE-CHARGE
        *> SERIOUSLY LATE PAYMENT PENALTY
        WHEN DAYS-LATE >= 46 AND DAYS-LATE <= 999
            COMPUTE LATE-CHARGE = AMT-DUE * 0.08
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 0 TO LATE-CHARGE
    END-EVALUATE.
